Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.67,0:00:05.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Muse over the antique memories
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.31,0:00:12.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Realize again every fragment shown to know why
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.39,0:00:18.86,Main,,0,0,0,,On my ugly dress in the millions of laughs occurs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.97,0:00:25.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Fool me but I could and I act like show is luxury
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.95,0:00:31.40,Main,,0,0,0,,A fantasy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.89,0:00:49.01,Main,,0,0,0,,For a long time, this body burned in the fire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.01,0:00:51.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Asking for the meaning of the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.57,0:00:58.06,Main,,0,0,0,,本当の二十歳の意味を尋ねて本当の二十歳の意味を尋ねて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.09,0:01:03.54,Main,,0,0,0,,それが人の汲めた呪いでもそれが人の汲めた呪いでも
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.85,0:01:13.17,Main,,0,0,0,,心が夢る名は咲かせましょう心が夢る名は咲かせましょう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.17,0:01:19.16,Main,,0,0,0,,それでも世が愛しい神様らは悪い
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.15,0:01:26.00,Main,,0,0,0,,壊れたと想像するほど生命線が座ってばかりで
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.19,0:01:32.04,Main,,0,0,0,,花びらが柔らかい毒薬の味が
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.61,0:01:40.46,Main,,0,0,0,,忘れられておられるまで囚われていたい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.35,0:01:56.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Chantelle, egg, flowers,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.53,0:01:58.54,Main,,0,0,0,,pick from my balm
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.03,0:02:05.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Hitoriko, tsumuete no kurishin
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.13,0:02:08.52,Main,,0,0,0,,My love for Brazil,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.83,0:02:12.34,Main,,0,0,0,,your vital human heart
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.33,0:02:18.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Mayu no naka de umarete kita, nagai wa doku
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.71,0:02:28.16,Main,,0,0,0,,声も目黒もないこの場所で
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.31,0:02:34.76,Main,,0,0,0,,朧に映る影に見とれてる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.89,0:02:41.34,Main,,0,0,0,,それが人の喰うまた呪いでも
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.25,0:02:48.45,Main,,0,0,0,,私にくれる Let's make it bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.45,0:02:52.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Even so, I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.95,0:02:59.70,Main,,0,0,0,,God's words and love The more I think about it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.19,0:03:05.85,Main,,0,0,0,,The more I can't live The petals are soft
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.85,0:03:13.79,Main,,0,0,0,,The taste of poison Thank you so much for watching this video, and I'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.79,0:03:17.70,Main,,0,0,0,,in the next video!